      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Traces convince him Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing have only about one rank three’s collective strength. In his appraisal he counts himself and Tie Dao Ku as rank three with two rank two helpers, enough to dominate once they close in. He also counts eight people when the group set out of Qing Mao Mountain. Fresh grass skirt monkey corpses under a week old lift his mood. Admirers watch him climb a slope and swear lifelong loyalty, then an intense explosion ends the chapter.",
      "chapters": [
        214
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_tie_dao_ku"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He walks with a cold expression.",
      "chapters": [
        214
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Only Tie Dao Ku remains as a Bai clan prisoner when he recalls the blast. Tie Ao Tian stands in the middle of the explosion and dies before he can activate a defensive Gu, leaving only a palm sized piece of flesh. Other clansmen die with him. Tie Dao Ku buries what he can, marks a rock tomb, and reads the site as nearly a hundred charred thunder potato Gu buried together.",
      "chapters": [
        220
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "slope-explosion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain",
        "sys_defensive_gu",
        "gu_charred_thunder_potato_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
